DesktopShortcuts=Desktop shortcuts
StartMenuShortcuts=Start Menu shortcuts
WelcomeDescription=VCMI is an open-source engine for Heroes III, offering new and extended possibilities. To use VCMI, you need to own the original data files.%n%nThis wizard will install VCMI - Open Heroes 3 on your device.%n%nIt is recommended that you close all other applications before continuing.%n%nClick Next to continue, or Cancel to exit Setup.
WelcomeHighlightsTitle=About VCMI
WelcomeHighlights=VCMI is a community-developed reimplementation of the Heroes of Might and Magic III engine. Its goal is to preserve the spirit of the original game, overcome the technical limits of the classic engine, and provide an open foundation for mods and continued development.
